# The web MVP reads https://tyterapp.github.io/codes-for-pro.txt directly.
# No VITE_TYTER_PRO_API is needed.
# Actions uses TYTER_PRO_CODES; local builds read the ignored root codes-for-pro.txt.
# Only one-way proofs are published, never the raw codes or emails.
# Never commit a real .env or a session database.

# Optional legacy Node service settings (not required for GitHub Pages):
TYTER_PUBLIC_URL=https://tyterapp.github.io
TYTER_PRO_CODES_PATH=codes-for-pro.txt
TYTER_PRO_SESSIONS_PATH=.web-pro-sessions.json
HOST=127.0.0.1
PORT=4173

